{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sweet Chaos is a car shooter in which you lead cute heroes into battle against the armies of evil.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Masses of Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a battle with your cute little hero against countless creatures. Don't be intimidated by the number of enemies! Be brave and defeat the enemy army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve Your Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills between missions and test new combinations while continually earning new rewards. Hundreds of challenges await you and your fellow players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with Friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Chaos was designed to offer a fast-paced and exciting gaming experience while maintaining focus and fun. Prepare to enjoy the game with your friends for hours.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The journey begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729030/4a0d58f5b733edeebf87da0a84fc400a6cf70f48.jpg"},{"name":"More players? More fun!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729030/c5e0a71c0554b1176906e95ff8c095e8c6ecd9f3.jpg"},{"name":"Is the music too loud again?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729030/11e3150e66dbe3c56e0c5f5ae6379989f0868e46.jpg"},{"name":"Is this the developer?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729030/3fe20114a2f1f8272fa298b25a58a4e4c30e1384.jpg"},{"name":"Does he also make videos?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729030/eb9f5c903913970e43b58f7cd42163e940d4acc3.jpg"},{"name":"I have a question!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729030/0d23b8c918cc511c5888fdb88c87a9000b34327f.jpg"},{"name":"The good old internet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.st